      ],
      "source": "https://tybeeisland.net/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tybee Island Light Station, built in the 18th century, is one of the few lighthouses from that era still operating in North America.",
